I really hated having to put on each type of armor, watch my AC change then
make a list of which armor had what base AC.  I know that the BAC of the armor
itself is listed in the Guidebook but not boots, helmets, cloaks, shields etc.

Reguardless of whether the rust argument results in evaporating armor, the
BASE AC should be listed in the description since these don't change.

---------------------------------From my being a Valkyrie.
A. a +3 small shield (+1) (being worn)
